# 8. PIR Integration

The PIR path was successfully integrated into the Hardware Manager architecture.

The final intended flow is:

```text
PIR MCU
   ↓
EEPROM EID
   ↓
Hardware Manager
   ↓
PIR entry node
   ↓
/pir_state
```

The PIR node publishes:

```text
/pir_state
```

as a ROS `Bool`.

Direct testing produced expected true/false transitions.

The PIR entry node was subsequently changed from independent device discovery to Hardware Manager assignment.

