# 9. RCWL Integration

The RCWL motion sensor followed the same architecture.

Its identity:

```text
DWUSA-01-02-01
TYPE=MOTION
SENSOR=RCWL
```

is discovered by the Hardware Manager.

The RCWL entry node receives its assigned serial port from the device map and publishes:

```text
/rcwl_state
```

The RCWL path was explicitly verified with real `true/false` readings.

This established the first clear pair of working motion inputs for the droid.

