# 14. Fusion and Higher-Level State

Once all individual sensor entry nodes were working, the next layer was brought online.

The motion sensors feed a fusion layer that generates:

```text
/fused_motion
```

The orientation inputs feed:

```text
/orientation_state
/orientation_summary
```

This successfully demonstrated that the robot was no longer merely reporting raw sensor measurements.

The ROS system was now interpreting those sensor values into higher-level states.

