# 22. Milestone Statement

**October 2, 2026 — Droidworks U.S.A. Droid #1 achieved its first fully integrated operational milestone.**

Droid #1 can now sense its environment using multiple physical sensor systems, identify its hardware modules through persistent EIDs, route those modules through a central Hardware Manager, process sensor information through ROS 2, generate higher-level orientation and affect states, express those states through onboard OLED eyes, and simultaneously present the droid's internal condition on a wireless CYD display.

The CYD has therefore evolved into the beginning of an external "window into the mind of the droid."

The next phase is no longer primarily about proving that the pieces can work.

It is about **turning the functioning prototype into a coherent robot platform** — consolidating startup, packaging the hardware, exposing useful internal variables, and developing controlled operator interaction without compromising the droid's autonomous architecture.
